# Installed agent skills are restored from skills-lock.json (committed source of truth:
# source repo, commit, hash). Skills written for this project are committed via the
# !-exceptions below; add one line per new project skill. .claude/skills/ holds the
# CLI's links to them.
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/verified-research-report/
!.agents/skills/price-check/
.claude/skills/
